WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Most of us want a quiet moment,
but we keep postponing it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
An illusion shows that changing orientation
can change what we notice.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
That is not proof a special audio frequency
can rewire the brain.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Try twelve minutes for free.
Keep notes about what actually happens.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Zen12 offers structured audio choices.
Check the tiers and evidence first.
